<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"> 
    <title>My Digital CV - Nadia Jackson</title>
    <style>
        /* General Page Styling */
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 950px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f7f9;
            color: #333;
        }

        /* HEADER SECTION */
        header {
            background: #003366; /* Embry-Riddle Blue */
            color: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            
            /* Flex container */
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column; 
            justify-content: space-between; 
            min-height: 350px; 
        }

        /* Top Row: Profile Picture Top Left */
        .header-top {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-start;
        }

        .profile-pic {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px; 
            border-radius: 50%; 
            border: 4px solid #fff;
            object-fit: cover; 
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        /* Middle Row: Name in Center */
        .header-middle {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            flex-grow: 1; /* Takes up available space to stay centered */
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin: 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        /* Bottom Row: Contact Info Bottom Right */
        .header-bottom {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-end; /* Aligns child elements to the right */
        }

        header h3 {
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: #add8e6;
        }

        header a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 15px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        header a:hover {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #add8e6;
        }

        /* SECTION STYLING */
        h2 {
            border-left: 5px solid #003366;
            padding-left: 15px;
            color: #003366;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        /* FORM STYLING */
        #contact-form {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        /* Flex container for form rows */
        .form-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px; /* Space between side-by-side inputs */
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* Flex item for form groups */
        .form-group {
            flex: 1; /* Makes inputs grow equally in a row */
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        label {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #555;
        }

        input, textarea, select {
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        input:focus, textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #003366;
            background-color: #f0f7ff;
        }

        button {
            background-color: #003366;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            width: 100%; /* Mobile friendly button */
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: #00509e;
        }

        /* Table Styling */
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden; /* Rounds the table corners */
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #003366;
            color: white;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="header-top">
            <img src="profile.jpg" alt="Nadia Jackson" class="profile-pic">
        </div>

        <div class="header-middle">
            <h1>Nadia Jackson</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="header-bottom">
            <h3>Mechanical Engineering Student</h3>
            <nav>
                <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/NadiaJackson" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
                <a href="https://github.com/loconana04-coder" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
                <a href="mailto:loconana04@gmail.com">Email Me</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section id="summary">
        <h2>Summary</h2>
        <p>
            Mechanical Engineering student at Embry-Riddle Aeronautical University with a strong foundation in 
            design and manufacturing. Focused on computational tools and programming languages to solve complex engineering challenges.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="coursework">
        <h2>Technical Proficiency</h2>
        <table>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Category</th>
                    <th>Subject/Software</th>
                    <th>Proficiency</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>Design Software</td>
                    <td>CATIA V5 & SolidWorks</td>
                    <td>Intermediate</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Programming</td>
                    <td>MatLab</td>
                    <td>In Progress</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Manufacturing</td>
                    <td>CNC Milling & Manual Lathe</td>
                    <td>Hands-on</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Me</h2>
        <div id="contact-form">
            <form action="#" method="post">
                <div class="form-row">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="name">Full Name</label>
                        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="John Doe" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="email">Email Address</label>
                        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="john@example.com" required>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-row">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="org">Organization</label>
                        <input type="text" id="org" name="organization" placeholder="Company/University">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="reason">Reason for Contact</label>
                        <select id="reason" name="reason">
                            <option value="job">Job Offer / Internship</option>
                            <option value="collaboration">Project Collaboration</option>
                            <option value="feedback">General Feedback</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
                    <label for="message">Message</label>
                    <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" placeholder="How can I help you?" required></textarea>
                </div>

                <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

</body>
</html>
